31 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(Using pre-trained models and transfer learning are both common approaches to building AI-based systems, but there are some risks associated which include:)/E(Using pre-trained models and transfer learning are both common approaches to building AI-based systems, but there are some risks associated which include:)/Pg 8 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

32 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 63 0 R/T(Lack of transparency - A pre-trained model may lack transparency compared to an internally generated model.)/E(Lack of transparency - A pre-trained model may lack transparency compared to an internally generated model.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

33 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 64 0 R/T(Domain Mismatch - The level of similarity between the function performed by the pre-trained model and the required functionality may be insufficient.)/E(Domain Mismatch - The level of similarity between the function performed by the pre-trained model and the required functionality may be insufficient.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

34 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 65 0 R/T(Likelihood of unknown defects - If the pre-trained model is not widely used, there are likely to be more unknown defects and more rigorous testing may be needed to mitigate this risk.)/E(Likelihood of unknown defects - If the pre-trained model is not widely used, there are likely to be more unknown defects and more rigorous testing may be needed to mitigate this risk.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

35 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 66 0 R/T(Inherited biases - may not be apparent if there is a lack of documentation about the data used to train the model.)/E(Inherited biases - may not be apparent if there is a lack of documentation about the data used to train the model.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

