39 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 15 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

40 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 67 0 R/T(Data Privacy Concerns - Pre-Trained models may have used proprietary data which may raise ethical or legal issues.)/E(Data Privacy Concerns - Pre-Trained models may have used proprietary data which may raise ethical or legal issues.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

41 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 68 0 R/T(Security Vulnerabilities - Models created through transfer learning are highly likely to be sensitive to the same vulnerabilities as the pre-trained model on which it is based.)/E(Security Vulnerabilities - Models created through transfer learning are highly likely to be sensitive to the same vulnerabilities as the pre-trained model on which it is based.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

42 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 69 0 R/T(Version Drift - Updates to pre-trained models can change behavior which might break downstream dependencies.)/E(Version Drift - Updates to pre-trained models can change behavior which might break downstream dependencies.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

43 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 70 0 R/T(Lack of Explainability - Many pre-trained models are black boxes, making it hard to interpret predictions or debug errors.)/E(Lack of Explainability - Many pre-trained models are black boxes, making it hard to interpret predictions or debug errors.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

44 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(Note that several of the above risks can be more easily mitigated by having thorough documentation available for the pre-trained model)/E(Note that several of the above risks can be more easily mitigated by having thorough documentation available for the pre-trained model)/Pg 9 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

